<title>USA: Chesapeake names Thomas Johnson president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake names Thomas Johnson president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Corp said on Thursday that it named Thomas Johnson its president and chief executive officer, effective August 1.</p>
<p>The company said in a news release that J. Carter Fox is retiring as president and chief executive, but will remain Chesapeake's chairman.</p>
<p>Johnson, 47, most recently was president and chief executive of Riverwood International Corp, Chesapeake said.</p>
<p>Chesapeake is a paper and forest products company.</p>
